        <h2 id="story-title" class="mt-4 font-light text-display-2 text-fg">From problem to business outcome.</h2>
        <a class="link-arrow mt-4" href="#contact">Skip the story <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
      </div></div>
    </div>
